      "name": "Adyen active incident: Partially degraded performance for SDR & PAR generation August 26 2026, 16:18 CEST Interfaces and reporting Identified August 26 2026, 16:18 CEST We have resolved an internal issue that began at 16:00 CEST on August 25, 2026, which caused delays in report generation. Currently, we are working through a backlog that affects the generation of the following reports: Settlement Detail Report (SDR) Payment Account Report (PAR) For scheduled reports, it is not necessary to manually request them via the Customer Area as they will be generated automatically once the backlog has caught up. Merchants configured to receive webhook notifications will be able to download their reports once the REPORT_AVAILABLE webhook notification is received. Our engineering teams are actively investigating and implementing mitigation measures. We will provide further updates as soon as we have more information.",
